# sync-config

Edit files inside `packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/`, not host-root copies. During `npm start`, template edits sync automatically. When webpack is not running, run `npm run project:bootstrap` and commit the generated host files.

## TypeScript

Ambient / `declare module` types belong in:

`packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/types/blockera/`

- Never add or edit a project-root `types/` folder.
- Do not stub packages that already ship TypeScript types (for example `@dnd-kit/*` or `overlayscrollbars`).

## Root configs

Templates belong in `packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/root-configs/`.

- Never hand-edit host-root copies (`.flowconfig`, `flow/` stubs, `.cspell/`, `.vscode/`, `.husky/`, `.nvmrc`, root config files).
